graph LR
    subgraph Setup
        A[Load .env] --> B[Read SOCRATA_APP_TOKEN]
        B --> C{Token present?}
        C -->|No| D[Raise ValueError]
        C -->|Yes| E[Build URL + params]
    end

    subgraph Request
        E --> F[GET with X-App-Token]
        F --> G[Parse JSON]
    end

    subgraph Output
        G --> H[Print status, count, keys]
        H --> I[Print first 3 records]
    end
